== catalogo
--- so o catalogo do repositorio
$ aurumcode xbom --type build --repo . --out repo.json
aurumcode xbom: build: 3 componente(s), 0 descartado(s) sem evidencia
exit_code=0
RESULTADO: catalogo do repositorio usado
$ jq .components[] | "\(.name) catalogo=\(.properties[]? | select(.name=="aurumcode:xbom:catalogo") | .value)" repo.json
actions/checkout catalogo=repositorio
actions/setup-go catalogo=repositorio
example/deploy-action catalogo=repositorio
$ jq .metadata.properties[] | select(.name|test("llm|dropped|catalog|candidates")) | "\(.name)=\(.value)" repo.json
aurumcode:xbom:candidates=3
aurumcode:xbom:catalog=repository
aurumcode:xbom:dropped_occurrences=0
aurumcode:xbom:dropped_without_evidence=0
aurumcode:xbom:llm=absent
--- com --politica: o catalogo da politica vence e o do repositorio e ignorado com aviso
$ aurumcode xbom --type build --repo . --politica /fixtures/politica --out politica.json
aurumcode xbom: .aurumcode/xbom/build.yml do repositorio ignorado: a politica central decide sozinha
aurumcode xbom: build: 3 componente(s), 0 descartado(s) sem evidencia
exit_code=0
RESULTADO: catalogo da politica usado, o do repositorio ignorado
$ jq .components[] | "\(.name) catalogo=\(.properties[]? | select(.name=="aurumcode:xbom:catalogo") | .value)" politica.json
actions/checkout catalogo=politica
actions/setup-go catalogo=politica
example/deploy-action catalogo=politica
$ jq .metadata.properties[] | select(.name|test("llm|dropped|catalog|candidates")) | "\(.name)=\(.value)" politica.json
aurumcode:xbom:candidates=3
aurumcode:xbom:catalog=policy
aurumcode:xbom:dropped_occurrences=0
aurumcode:xbom:dropped_without_evidence=0
aurumcode:xbom:llm=absent
